### Task Table

| **Name** | **Text** | **Relation** | **Location** | **Number of Robots** |
|----------|----------|--------------|--------------|-----------------------|
| **AT1**  | Collect resources from storage location 1 | OR | Storage Location 1 | 1 |
| **AT2**  | Collect resources from storage location 2 | OR | Storage Location 2 | 1 |
| **AT3**  | Collect resources from storage location 3 | OR | Storage Location 3 | 1 |
| **AT4**  | Deliver resources to the specified location | AND | Delivery Location | 1 |
| **AT5**  | Return to recharging station | AND | Recharging Station | 1 |
| **AT6**  | Assign mission to another robot | AND | Any Location | 1 |
| **AT7**  | Return resources to checkpoint | AND | Checkpoint | 1 |
| **AT8**  | Trigger alert for failed resource return | AND | Any Location | 1 |

